<!-- Additional Info -->
<div class="text-center mt-5">
  <div
    class="rounded-md p-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto"
  >
    <div class="mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand/10 px-4 py-2 mx-auto rounded-md">
      <span class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-dark"> FAQ </span>
    </div> 
    <h2 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
      Frequently Asked Questions
    </h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-left mt-10 text-lg">
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          Do patients need to download an app?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          No! Patients simply scan your QR code or visit your booking link. Everything works through their web browser and WhatsApp - no app downloads required.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          How long does setup take?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Most clinics are up and running in under 5 minutes. Add your schedule, customize your settings, generate your QR code, and you're ready to accept bookings. No technical expertise needed.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          Will this change our existing workflow?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Not at all! Our system is designed to work alongside your current processes. The token system runs in the background and enhances what you already do. Your staff continues working normally.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          How does the WhatsApp token system work?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
         Walk-ins scan your QR code and instantly get a token number via WhatsApp. They receive live updates on their queue position and estimated wait time, reducing crowding in the waiting room.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          Can we manage multiple doctors?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Yes! Professional and Enterprise plans support multiple doctor profiles, each with their own schedule, specialties, patient management, and separate booking calendars.
        </p>
      </div>   
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          Is patient data secure?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Absolutely. We use bank-level encryption and are fully HIPAA-compliant. Patient data is stored securely and never shared with third parties. You maintain complete control over your information.
        </p>
      </div>  
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          How do reminders reduce no-shows?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Automated WhatsApp reminders are sent 24 hours and 2 hours before appointments. Patients can confirm, reschedule, or cancel with one tap. Our clinics see up to 80% reduction in no-shows.
        </p>
      </div>  
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          Can we try it before committing?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Absolutely! Every plan includes a 14-day free trial with full access to all features. No credit card required to start. Experience everything before making a decision.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">
          What if we don't have WhatsApp Business?
        </h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          No problem! We help you set up WhatsApp Business as part of onboarding. It's free and takes just a few minutes. Our team guides you through the entire process.
        </p>
      </div>         
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bricolage tracking-wider font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2 text-xl">What kind of support do you offer?</h4>
        <p class="text-gray-700">
          Starter plans get email support (24-hour response). Professional plans get priority support with live chat. Enterprise customers get a dedicated account manager and phone support.
        </p>
      </div>               
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
